+
+. Update `.clang-format` to encode the canonical formatting rules (Allman, compact namespaces, no column limit).
+. Maintain `.clang-tidy` with bugprone/performance/modernize suites plus Feel++ naming allowances.
+. Keep `.editorconfig` aligned on LF endings, UTF-8, and four-space C++ indentation.
+. Refresh `AGENTS.md` as the LLM-friendly primer with explicit namespace and member naming notes.
+. Expand `.github/CONTRIBUTING.md` to cover formatting, tidy usage, pre-commit hooks, and CI requirements.
+. Provide `.pre-commit-config.yaml` for clang-format and codespell with vendor exclusions.
+. Ensure GitHub Actions enforce clang-format and clang-tidy against generated `compile_commands.json`.
